#: ../../tools/bgee_tools.rst:65 a0f504896055484daadaf7982ebbf0e1
msgid "**Name**: ``Bgee_list_species``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/bgee_tools.rst:67 72bfec01b8a44c49ad0e76e86fedb05a
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all species available in the Bgee gene expression "
"database. Returns species with taxonomy IDs, genome versions, and common "
"names. Bgee currently covers 29+ animal species including major model "
"organisms (human, mouse, zebrafish, fruit fly, C. elegans, rat) and "
"additional vertebrates and invertebrates. Useful for discovering which "
"species are available before querying gene expression data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/bgee_tools.rst:71 6a4a45f1326243229e018dc0793d8f7e
msgid "No parameters required."
msgstr ""

